    {
      "name": "cascading-percentage-discounts",
      "notes": "Two cascading percentages applied in order: 100 × (1-10%) × (1-5%) = 85.50. ROUNDING TIE VECTOR: 85.50 × 23% = 19.665 exactly, an exact half-cent — expected tax_amount 19.67 only holds under ROUND_HALF_UP (banker's rounding would give 19.66). See the top-level description for what this means for non-PHP consumers.",
      "input": {
